{"synopsis":"Tahun 237 Kalender Kekaisaran\nPada akhir perang Trust untuk melindungi umat manusia dari Korupsi yang merajalela\nSang Sword Saint Karryl McGovern dihadapkan dengan pengkhianatan oleh Oliver yang merupakan teman baiknya sekalligus Kaisar dari negara di mana dia mengabdikan dirinya\nSetelah membunuh sang Kaisar Karryl kembali ke masa lalu untuk memperbaiki semua yang terjadi\nDan kini aku mendapatkan kekuatan yang tidak pernah kudapatkan di kehidupanku sebelumnya yakni Sihir dan Swordmanship\nAku akan mengubah masa depan dengan kedua kemampuan ini","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"ARC, 윤소함, 이형석","artist":"","chapters":[{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"2f796080-99b6-413b-a654-1b66c888ac26","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"f46aad98-1a27-4e47-994d-cef4c180b3f1","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"404698b6-1e7b-4080-b764-aef4d95bc719","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"be5ff9ef-b862-4fe0-813d-03c666cbe270","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"32c4cb8f-641c-4e9b-bdc7-3b62417c68d9","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"38871c90-b99a-4c54-bab8-ca026cc5037d","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"3168a0cd-f9c5-44a6-86bb-b0f6c8fe573c","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"2045b255-81df-4aaa-a59c-028eb7ab57ed","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"df33c8a2-eb47-4485-b216-25f06adb3116","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"10de0453-55a1-47df-8496-61dec86358b1","date":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"65c0ff09-160a-4ba7-ad7a-e28d369d4ccf","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"8feea432-2a84-4e91-9ee0-0489ea87eb3e","date":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"fabf3d